# every check and tool the gate runs, in one binary, chosen by its first argument:
#
#     mdd gate            every check, in order
#     mdd gate --list     the program names it answers to
#     mdd gate window     one check on its own
#
# Adding a program means adding run(args) to it and a case in mdd.check.Gate, and nothing else.
-cp src
-main mdd.check.Gate
-cpp export/obj/gate

-D analyzer-optimize
-D HXCPP_OPTIMIZE_LINK
-D HXCPP_GC_GENERATIONAL
